      },
      "texte_contexte": "White Wolf : Get Up Close and Personal with Wolves at Colorado Wolf and Wildlife Center. Located near Divide, Colorado (about two hours outside of Denver), CWWC offers educational tours to the public to learn about, howl with, and visit ambassador wolves. The 35-acre center is home to species of wolves, coyotes, red foxes, and swift foxes, with a mission to educate the public on ecosystems, preservation, and conservation.",
